        "original_id": "eecd8516-ac5e-556a-ac2f-931845a0cbb8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wes Studi, Graham Greene, Amanda Wyss\n- Films: Powwow Highway, Dances with Wolves, The Last of the Mohicans, The New World, Silverado, Better Off Dead, Shakma, The Id\n- Places: Nofire Hollow, Oklahoma\n- Roles: actor, film producer, supporting roles\n\nFacts:\n- Wes Studi was born on December 17, 1947, and is a Cherokee actor and film producer from Nofire Hollow in Oklahoma.\n- Amanda Wyss starred in Silverado in 1985 and Better Off Dead in 1985.\n- Wes Studi and Graham Greene, who were relatively unknown actors at the time, had small supporting roles in Powwow Highway.\n- Amanda Wyss starred in Powwow Highway in 1989 and Shakma in 1990.\n- Wes Studi appeared in the Academy Award-winning film Dances with Wolves in 1990.\n- Wes Studi appeared in the Academy Award-winning film The Last of the Mohicans in 1992.\n- Wes Studi appeared in the Academy Award-nominated film The New World in 2005.\n- Amanda Wyss starred in The Id in 2016.",
